Third-party component
---------------------
This artifact bundles the source of wordgen, an independent tool used only as a
comparison baseline for one figure (the k-sweep, Fig. 6). It is not part of
VolTRE.

  wordgen
  Authors:  Benoit Barbot and contributors
  Upstream: https://git.lacl.fr/barbot/wordgen.git  (commit 5502f65b)
  License:  GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPLv3)
  Bundled:  artifact/wordgen-src-5502f65.tar.gz

The full GPLv3 text and upstream copyright notices are inside that source
tarball (COPYING). The Docker image compiles the wordgen binary from exactly
this vendored source, so the corresponding source required by GPLv3 ships with
the artifact.
